      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Chester Creek supplied water power to mills, and the 1838 arrival of the Philadelphia‑Wilmington‑Baltimore Railroad opened new commercial possibilities.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
